OL,3,AAnthropic boss Dario Amodei calls for
OL,4,AAI development to slow down
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of leading AI company
OL,7,FAnthropic has called for the pace of
OL,8,Fdevelopment of artificial intelligence
OL,9,Fmodels to slow down and to be closely
OL,10,Fmonitored.
OL,12,FIn a long essay called We Must Pace the
OL,13,FFrontier, Dario Amodei said developing
OL,14,FAI was not in question, but the risks
OL,15,Fassociated with it were "serious" and
OL,16,Fcompanies and governments must be given
OL,17,Ftime to address them.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
