OL,3,AAnthropic boss Dario Amodei calls for
OL,4,AAI development to slow down
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe proposed a three-point plan that
OL,7,Fincludes independent monitoring of AI
OL,8,Fmodels as they are developed,
OL,9,Findustry-wide regulation and global
OL,10,Fregulation.
OL,12,FThere have been growing concerns
OL,13,Frecently about the technology's
OL,14,Fpotential risks - the most serious of
OL,15,Fwhich suggested there is a greater than
OL,16,F10% chance it "could kill all humans"
OL,17,Fwithin the next decade.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
